''text'' has been so far reduced to:

subsentence = sentence | prenex subsentence 
prenex = terms ZOhU # 
sentence = [[terms [[CU #]] bridi-tail 
bridi-tail = selbri tail-terms | gek-sentence 
gek-sentence = gek subsentence gik subsentence tail-terms
| [[tag] KE # gek-sentence /KEhE#/
| NA # gek-sentence 
tail-terms = [[terms] /VAU#/
terms = term ... 
term = sumti 
        | (tag | FA #) (sumti | /KU#/) 
        | NUhI # gek terms /NUhU#/ gik terms /NUhU#/  
        | NA KU # 
sumti = sumti-6 [[relative-clauses]
          | quantifier KOhA1 xi number [[relative-clauses]
          | gek sumti gik sumti
selbri = [tag] selbri-1 
selbri-1 = selbri-6 | NA # selbri 

(Where ''selbri-6'' is an untagged/unnegated selbri, ''sumti-6'' is an unquantified sumti.)

